    "title": "25 Words Quickcap: 11/26/2025",
    "text": "Challengers with Colton Dunn: Curt & Bonita (former magicians who are married)\nChamps with Amber Stevens West: Eric & Sam (2 day: 1 prize + $10,500)\nRound 1\nTurn #1 answers: HOT, SOAR, GROUNDHOG, MOO, REHEARSE- Bid: 18 (Colton)- Clears List\nTurn #2 answers (Curt v. Eric): UNDER, SOMETIMES, STOMACH, HOOT, INSTAGRAM- Bid: 15 (Eric)- Missed SOMETIMES\nSuperfan of the Day: Bryon (MY20 VISION in Tomball, TX)\nTurn #3 answers: WORK, RAT, BAREFOOT, FATAL, SEWER– Bid: 14 (Bonita)- Holding on to All 750 (Shutting out by the Champs 750-0)\nRound 2\n| Green Words (250) | Yellow Words (500) | Red Words (1000) |\n| FIFTY (Colton) | FRITOS (Amber) | FIELD DAY |\n| RUDE | JAMIE (Amber) | MAGNOLIA (Colton) |\n| HELLO | BLUSH (Colton) | POLAR (Amber) |\n| BELOW (Amber) | COFFEE (Colton) | AIRHORN |\n| DEPARTURE | HUSTLER (Amber) | APOSTROPHE (Colton) |\nChamps: Completes List (3750)\nChallengers (needs all to win): Out on APOSTROPHE (750+2250=3000) (Kicked out from the Show with Chicago Steak Co. & $500)\nMoney Round (Eric): Missed 1 answer (TRYP Orlando is the Destination for them)(3 day: $10,500 + 2 prize)\nMy Rating: 6.5\nJerry’s Rating: 6 (D+)",
